  "description": "At Cretin-Derham Hall, students attend a beautiful, historic high school known for its rigorous academics, strong extracurriculars, and championship-winning athletics. The school offers students incredible programs and opportunities, including 1:1 mentoring programs where students are paired with mentors from world-renowned accounting firms, over 40 STEM courses in a wide range of fields an and a unique Leadership Academy. The school also has an award-winning arts program, with opportunities in fine and performing arts. The school is in a beautiful, historic building, while also offering students advanced technology (including virtual reality headsets and digital microscopes) and recently-renovated athletic facilities. Outside of the classroom, Cretin-Derham Hall offers students a robust extracurricular program, with clubs and championship-winning athletic teams. Timestamps Updated",
